<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Jackson County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, January to February and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 years. In 2025 on the middle, November to December ended at 41% of normal and October to November at 60%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 43% and March to April at 44% on the middle.</p>"}
